WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.975
Predict the count, then run the experiment.

2
00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:08.178
A six has probability one sixth, so expect ten in sixty rolls.

3
00:00:09.132 --> 00:00:12.132
Now roll sixty times, ten at a time.

4
00:00:21.763 --> 00:00:25.288
Close to ten, but rarely exactly. Chance varies.
